'''Rising wave''' is a water-type spell that creates a surge of water.

==Description==
Rising wave has a central water sigil surrounded by a ring of column keystones. On half of the glyph, directional keystones are located between the column keystones. This spell creates a surge of water that travels up diagonally, allowing the caster to propel themselves up into the air. The glyph was used by Qifrey in his battle with Sasaran.{{Ref|m|27}}

==Usage==
[[Qifrey]] used the glyph during his battle with [[Sasaran]] in the [[Serpentback Cave]].{{Ref|m|27}}

